mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Need a Flow to touch records] --> Q1{Must the interview honor the user’s object permissions and FLS?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| UserCtx[Keep or force user context; grant only needed CRUD/FLS]
  Q1 -->|No but honor sharing| SysShare[System context with sharing]
  Q1 -->|Must see all rows| Q2{Is this Experience Cloud or guest?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Stop[Do not default to system without sharing; minimize fields or redesign]
  Q2 -->|Internal admin automation| SysAll[System context without sharing, minimum fields]
  Need --> Q3{User cannot launch the Flow at all?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Grant[Run Flows, Manage Flow, or share that Flow]
  Need --> Q4{Invoked via REST?}
  Q4 -->|Yes| RestUser[Authenticated user context for object and FLS]
